    <bpmn:process id="W_W2665" name="W2665. App Conversion Rate Optimization &amp; Checkout Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly analytics
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~43K ecommerce orders/month
Owner: Ecommerce Manager
Participants: Ecommerce Mgr, Digital Product Manager, IT
Source: workflow W2665 — App Conversion Rate Optimization &amp; Checkout Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2665_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2665_Lane1" name="Ecommerce Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2665_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2665_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2665_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2665_Lane2" name="Digital Product Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2665_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2665_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2665_Start4" name="Monthly analytics">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2665_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2665_Task5" name="Ecommerce Manager analyzes checkout funnel: view → cart → checkout → payment →…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Ecommerce Manager analyzes checkout funnel: view → cart → checkout → payment → complete; identifies drop-off points; calculates abandonment rate
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1–2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2665_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2665_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2665_Task6" name="Digital Product Manager implements conversion-rate optimizations: guest…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Digital Product Manager implements conversion-rate optimizations: guest checkout, saved payments, one-click reorder, shipping transparency, social proof, urgency elements; A/B tests each
Responsible (R): Digital Product Manager / Ecommerce Manager
Accountable (A): CIO / CMO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2665_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2665_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2665_Task7" name="Ecommerce Manager reports: conversion rate (&gt;3%), cart abandonment, AOV…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ecommerce Manager reports: conversion rate (&gt;3%), cart abandonment, AOV, payment distribution, mobile vs. web; tracks CRO (conversion-rate-optimization) impact monthly
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2665_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2665_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2665_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2665_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2665_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-456 (ensure controlled execution — Digital Engagement Analytics &amp; Optimization (PA-75.3).) | - operational: Ecommerce Manager sign-off on the workflow output
